hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"222","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Abu Salma bin Abdur Rahman bin Auf se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se koi Namaz padhne khada hota hai to shaitan us ke paas aata hai aur use khalt-malt kar deta hai yahan tak ke use maloom nahi rehta ke kitni Namaz padhi, phir jab tum mein se koi ye pae to baith kar do sajde kare."
"223","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main bhoolta hun ya bhulaya jata hun taake sunnat qaim karun."
"224","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke aik shakhs ne Qasim bin Muhammad se sawal kya aur kaha ke main apni Namaz mein khayalon mein pad jata hun aur ye mujh par bahut hota hai. To Qasim bin Muhammad ne kaha ke apni Namaz mein aage badho kyunke ye tum se na jaye ga yahan tak ke tum laut jao aur tum kehte ho ke maine apni Namaz puri na ki."
